          .num_defn
            %h6#definition_2 Definition
            %p
              An elliptic curve over a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field"} field
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/positive+characteristic"} positive characteristic
              whose
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/formal+group+law"} formal group law
              has
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/height+of+a+formal+group"} height
              equal to 2 is called a
              = succeed "." do
                %em
